          "summary": "The account-registry excerpt lists ACC-B1 as active but leaves the owner and controller fields blank. It contains an internal account label and creation date, but no identity-verification record, customer identifier, or provider signature connecting the account to Bob Niran or another individual.",
          "timestamp_text": null
        }
